      "coordinateChannel": "time",
      "coordinateSemantic": "time",
      "coordinateUnit": "s",
      "promotionReady": true,
      "limitation": "High-resolution injection-flow quantity exported from the standard machine control. The paper's -10/+10/+20% experiment reconstructs an approximately 59.83 baseline on the delivered source scale; unit is governed from the Allrounder 520E engineering quantity convention and source context."
    },
    {
      "sourceChannel": "dataset1/ds1_scalar_and_quality.csv:weight",
